Open Vanilla 0038: Duels Lite, the bare arena. OpenVanilla.Duels.Lite = 1: everyone waits in Gurubashi and duels
whoever they like (/duel; the hangout heals and resets both after). No queues, matches, rooms, watching or bets:
every "q ..." command answers "err,lite". Gear, specs, party and chat stay. The hello line gets a seventh field,
1 in Lite, so the addons show only what there is. 0 brings it all back.

